juno-drivers (0.5.48.2+diamon10) unstable; urgency=low

  * juno-drivers-diamon Depends: juno-kde-fancontrol, ec-sys-dkms; and
    clevo-keyboard-dkms Depends: juno-drivers-diamon. Closes the 4-way Juno
    Depends cycle together with those two packages and ec-sys-dkms, so
